      "title": "Chemische Handlungsoptionen kriteriengeleitet bewerten",
      "packageId": "07-methods-redox-everyday",
      "decision": "KEEP",
      "scopeOfDecision": "Only exact concrete own-acquisition/source-scope proposal and retained full current requirements. No replacement native/global science or source-coverage vote.",
